WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Choose a workspace and ask what you want to see.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
Metrics, trends and tables appear on your canvas.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
Click Add text, then type your own notes.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
Click any component title. Rename it, then press Enter.

00:15.000 --> 00:18.000
Drag a component handle to choose its position.

00:18.000 --> 00:21.000
Click a line, bar or legend to choose a color.

00:21.000 --> 00:24.000
Save your current layout, text and charts as a PDF.
